Description: Downgrade Cargo.lock to v3 for Ubuntu cargo
 Ubuntu 24.04 ships cargo 1.75 which cannot parse Cargo.lock version 4.
 Apply this patch during package build so the upstream orig tarball remains
 unchanged (Launchpad rejects changing .orig.tar.* for same upstream version).
Forwarded: not-needed (packaging-only)
Author: Jackson Delahunt <jackson@jacksondelahunt.com>

--- a/Cargo.lock
+++ b/Cargo.lock
@@
-version = 4
+version = 3
